<mxfile><diagram id="diff" name="diff"><mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="notes" value="WF-03 Workflow: 6 thay đổi. Xanh lá = thêm · Đỏ = xoá · Vàng cam = đổi; phần còn lại làm mờ.&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Open recommendation → View the proposed booking for the agreed way&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Claim task” → activity “Open recommendation” → activity “Claim task” → system activity “Propose a booking of the agreed way in priority order (SF-10 Scheduling plan and revisions)”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: notification “✉ Notify tester” → activity “Open recommendation” → notification “✉ Notify tester” → system activity “Propose a booking of the agreed way in priority order (SF-10 Scheduling plan and revisions)”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Open recommendation” → system activity “Rank fit machines” → system activity “Propose a booking of the agreed way in priority order (SF-10 Scheduling plan and revisions)” → activity “View the proposed booking for the agreed way”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: system activity “Rank fit machines” → decision “Slot before due date?” → activity “View the proposed booking for the agreed way” → decision “Slot before due date?”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Rank fit machines → Propose a booking of the agreed way in priority order (SF-10 Scheduling plan and revisions)" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=17;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="2420" height="198" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_l" value="Trước" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="226" width="1170" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_r" value="Sau" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=18;fontFamil